本项目是对第三方硬件（Moispano720 / TL-6A 系列蓝牙云台）通信协议的
独立观测与重实现，不包含原厂 App 的任何代码或反编译产物。

This project is an independent observation and re-implementation of a
third-party BLE protocol. It contains no code or decompiled artifacts from
the vendor app. Use at your own risk.
